### SAR445953 Two-Gate Patient Selection (Derived from CEACAM5 Decode)

**Gate 1 — CEACAM5 expression:**
- Threshold: ≥80% (not ≥50%) — based on CARMEN-LC03 post-hoc signal (OS HR=0.71 trend)
- IHC assay: Sanofi clone 769 (validated for CEACAM5) or commercial equivalent

**Gate 2 — IO permissiveness:**
- Biomarker: pTMB ≥28 mut/Mb OR Immunoscore-IC-high OR DetermaIO IOOPT+
- Rationale: CEACAM5-Topo1 ADC releases cytotoxic payload → bystander killing → requires IO-permissive TME for immune activation cascade
- Estimated eligible population: 8–12% of MSS CRC (vs. ~25% CEACAM5 ≥2+/≥50%)

